==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|grc|en}} {{term|δενδρίτης|tr=dendrites||of or pertaining to a tree|lang=grc}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/ˈdɛndɹaɪt/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{context|cytology|lang=en}} A slender projection of a [[nerve cell]] which conducts [[nerve impulse]]s from a [[synapse]] to the body of the cell; a [[dendron]].
# {{context|cytology|lang=en}} Slender cell process emanating from the cell bodies of dendritic cells and follicular dendritic cells of the immune system.
# {{context|crystallography|metallurgy|lang=en}} tree-like structure of crystals growing as material crystallizes

